D:  Ver= 2.00 Cls=ef(misc ) Sub=02 Prot=01 MxPS=64 #Cfgs=  1
P:  Vendor=2c7c ProdID=0312 Rev= 3.18
S:  Manufacturer=Quectel
S:  Product=Quectel EM05-CN
